%% Upload + extraction sequence (IMPLEMENTED)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Faculty
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant X as pdf.js + tesseract.js
  participant API as API routes
  participant S as Services
  participant DB as Postgres
  F->>UI: choose file + kind
  UI->>API: POST …/sources
  API->>S: validate type, size, hash
  S->>DB: store file + audit
  API-->>UI: 201 source id
  UI->>API: status = processing
  UI->>X: text layer, else OCR
  X-->>UI: page text + confidence
  UI->>API: POST …/extraction
  API->>S: saveExtraction
  S->>DB: page text
  S->>DB: candidates + snippets
  S->>DB: attendance drafts
  S->>DB: resolve fields
  S->>DB: audit + status
  API-->>UI: result
  Note over UI,API: On error the browser reports "failed".<br/>Processing over 15 min counts as failed.
